Z||000000||RiceCooker||06-12-2000||01:51 PM||||Pulled up to a del sol yesterday with a supra spoiler and of course a 4" fartcan and i asked him if he wanted to go. He looked over and mouthed, "no way" <BR>Either he was just too cool to race me or he knows that fieros can haul a**!<P>||||reg||7
Z||000001||Gold-86SE||06-12-2000||02:06 PM||||<BR>Don't know if it is respect, but he may have understood that the Fiero would destroy his Ricer, because his "performance mobile" was not up to "performance" par.<P>Let me side step the topic, and share with you guys an episode that happened to me during my trek home for lunch.<P>I was pulling out of the office parking lot, and had to wait on a few cars before I could pull out on the street.  In this lump of cars, there was a '95 or so Teal Firebird who was pulling up the rear.  After he passed, I pulled out and spun my tires for good measure, and he must have heard me. I quickly caught up to the Firebird staying behind him, yet not tail gating.<P>After I caught up, he started revving his engine at me, so I revved mine back.  We did this a few of times until we approached the next light, but that light ended anything that may have transpired, because I went right and he went straight. Yet, it was fun and good natured, and was a great way to begin the lunch hour.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000002||lennyb4||06-12-2000||02:51 PM||||I would have to say yes to a point.. I have smoked some ricers around my area and i have noticed that if i go to the store or something and thier hanging around they comment on my little baby. Plus i think the fiero is finally starting to get its due among performance / street racer groups. Man i love my car.....WHOOOOO HOOOOOOO||||reg||6
Z||000003||87PegasusGT||06-12-2000||03:27 PM||||I was going downtown btw stop lights and I like to let the 5spd do the engine braking in 1st because I love the sound of the 3.4. I have had NO ricers challenge me. I have had more than a couple go "Dang is that thing fast?""What's your 1/4 times?" "What do you have in that thing?". It sounds ALOT better than any fart can, and with the couple exterior mods I've added, the only cars I'v had who offer to play are 3rd Gen RX7s, new Mustwangs, and a some Mitsumisshis. It gets ALOT more respect than it used to. Unfortunately, I used to have more than 1 ricer disrepect it, but no more  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000004||mshill||06-12-2000||07:18 PM||||87Pegasus, did you take on the 3rd gen RX7s?  I can't hardly believe any Fiero (except maybe a 3.8SC) would be able to hold a candle to the twin turbo rotary in those things.  My brother-in-law owns one and he scares the heck out of me every time I am in the car with him.  They are fast and handle as good as they look.||||reg||1
Z||000005||GT Bastard||06-12-2000||09:59 PM||||If I was driving a base coupe, I would probably get the impression that he was mocking me, but if it was the GT or SE V6 I would suspect that he feared a loss.  The aero-nose, GFX, and spoilers just give the Fiero that extra tuff look. ||||reg||1
Z||000006||Formula||06-12-2000||10:22 PM||||My formula seems to get respect.....<P>Maybe its the spoiler.....<P>or maybe the 225/60-15Rs out back or the 205/60-15Rs in front....<P>or maybe the extra shiny paint......<P>maybe its the shiny chrome rings on the wheels...........<P>or maybe the racing stripe.......<P>or it might be the gutted exhaust......<P>could it be the 5% tint?.........<P>or the Monkey tailight mods......<P>maybe the its the non-aero coupe style?.....<P>naw, its cause its a FIERO!!!!!!!!!!<P>its defenitely not the bass either......<P>but it gets the respect it deserves.....<P>and thats A LOT of it!!!!!!!||||reg||1
Z||000007||Dan86gt3.8||06-13-2000||02:54 AM||||I know my 3.8 naturally aspirated is carving a little bit of a notch in the local street scene as something not to be blown off.  Everytime we go out to the street races and they see me launch like a bat out of hell some rednecks scratch thier head and wonder what in the hell is goin on here?  Maybe if I can sit down a 5.0 or 4.6 stang I can make it a legend (j/k).  I mean don't get me wrong, lt&ls1's eat my lunch but I have yet to have a problem with a ricer, or any truck!||||reg||1
Z||000008||87PegasusGT||06-13-2000||01:19 PM||||I just ate a perfect White 5.0 Stang GT this morning.He was surprised, but pretty cool. I knew the RX7 would eat me on the freeway, but off the line, its actually really close.||||reg||1
